<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89984" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσποί-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taking something to oneself, acquisition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυμμαχίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρώτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					17.4.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pretension</i> or <i>claim</i> to a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.62
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				184c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρωνεία</span> is defined as
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐπὶ χεῖρον πράξεων καὶ λόγων</span>
			<i>affectation</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				3.129b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εἰς οὐσίαν π</span>.
				<i>pretension</i> to real existence, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.6.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pretension, affectation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1165b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
